Description: Buddhi AI (बुद्धि) — India-first AI assistant for Vajra OS
 Buddhi is the built-in AI assistant for Vajra OS, designed to be:
 .
  * Agentic — can execute tasks, not just chat
  * Voice-controlled — supports Indian languages (Hindi, Tamil, Bengali, etc.)
  * Privacy-first — runs completely locally, no cloud APIs
  * India-aware — understands Indian context, festivals, currency, languages
 .
 Features:
  * Voice recognition with Indian language support
  * Text-to-speech in Hindi and English
  * System control (launch apps, change settings, manage files)
  * Code generation and execution
  * Indian calendar (Panchang) integration
  * Vedic math calculations
  * GST calculator
  * Festival reminders
  * Ayurveda health tips
 .
 All processing happens locally — your data never leaves your machine.
